WEBVTT

00:07:29.609 --> 00:07:33.990
There's only been what I call
the great monotony.

00:07:34.807 --> 00:07:39.545
So, Qohelet was accidentally
even more right

00:07:39.569 --> 00:07:42.410
about the universe beyond the Sun

00:07:42.434 --> 00:07:44.736
than he was about under the Sun.

00:07:45.156 --> 00:07:48.827
So long as the great monotony lasts,

00:07:48.851 --> 00:07:51.414
what has been out there

00:07:51.438 --> 00:07:53.406
really is what will be.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.982
And there is nothing out there

00:07:55.006 --> 00:07:59.034
of which it can truly be said,
"Look, this is new."

00:07:59.646 --> 00:08:01.637
Nevertheless,